    "chapter_thesis": "Diffractive Neural Networks (ODNNs) fundamentally replace electronic weight matrices with spatially varying phase profiles that implement linear transformations via Fresnel or Fraunhofer diffraction, creating a computing paradigm defined by the interplay of wave physics, layer architecture, and material constraints.",
